{
 "difference_id": "T2050a320",
 "property_summary": "For any non-empty _tos array and any target callee that implements transferFrom(address,address,uint256) or a recorder, C.transfer always makes successful external calls (i.e., completes without revert) to that selector for every element; the mutant switches the selector to approve(address,uint256) so calls will not match the intended transferFrom signature and may fail or be unrecognized (causing different observed behavior), so there exist inputs where the mutant causes the transfer call to revert or produce different recorded calldata.",
 "render_status": "rendered",
